{"suttaId":"tha-ap56","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4023,4047],"vripara":"25"},"segments":{"tha-ap56:0.3":"Gandhodakiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap56:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa,","tha-ap56:1.2":"mahābodhimaho ahu;","tha-ap56:1.3":"Vicittaṃ ghaṭamādāya,","tha-ap56:1.4":"gandhodakamadāsahaṃ. 26.","tha-ap56:2.1":"“Nhānakāle ca bodhiyā,","tha-ap56:2.2":"mahāmegho pavassatha;","tha-ap56:2.3":"Ninnādo ca mahā āsi,","tha-ap56:2.4":"asaniyā phalantiyā. 27.","tha-ap56:3.1":"“Tenevāsanivegena,","tha-ap56:3.2":"tattha kālaṅkato [kālakato (sī. syā.)] ahaṃ [ahuṃ (sī.)];","tha-ap56:3.3":"Devaloke ṭhito santo,","tha-ap56:3.4":"imā gāthā abhāsahaṃ. 28.","tha-ap56:4.1":"“‘Aho buddho aho dhammo, aho no satthusampadā;","tha-ap56:4.3":"Kaḷevaraṃ [kalebaraṃ (sī.)] me patitaṃ,","tha-ap56:4.4":"devaloke ramāmahaṃ. 29.","tha-ap56:5.1":"“‘Ubbiddhaṃ bhavanaṃ mayhaṃ,","tha-ap56:5.2":"satabhūmaṃ samuggataṃ;","tha-ap56:5.3":"Kaññāsatasahassāni,","tha-ap56:5.4":"parivārenti maṃ sadā. 30.","tha-ap56:6.1":"“‘Ābādhā me na vijjanti,","tha-ap56:6.2":"soko mayhaṃ na vijjati;","tha-ap56:6.3":"Pariḷāhaṃ na passāmi,","tha-ap56:6.4":"puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ. 31.","tha-ap56:7.1":"“‘Aṭṭhavīse kappasate,","tha-ap56:7.2":"rājā saṃvasito ahuṃ;","tha-ap56:7.3":"Sattaratanasampanno,","tha-ap56:7.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalo’. 32.","tha-ap56:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe…","tha-ap56:8.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap56:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā gandhodakiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap56:10.1":"Gandhodakiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ. 5."},"unsure":["tha-ap56:4.1"],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2566,"to":2567,"paras":[{"para":2566,"vripara":"25","refs":["tha-ap56:1"],"lines":["So ekadivasaṃ attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumutarassā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ vuttatthameva.","<b>Mahābodhimaho ahū</b>ti mahābodhirukkhassa pūjā ahosīti attho.","<b>Vicittaṃ ghaṭamādāyā</b>ti anekehi cittakammasuvaṇṇakammehi vicittaṃ sobhamānaṃ gandhodakapuṇṇaṃ ghaṭaṃ gahetvāti attho.","<b>Gandhodakamadāsaha</b>nti gandhodakaṃ adāsiṃ, ahaṃ gandhodakena abhisiñcinti attho. 26."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"]]},{"para":2567,"vripara":"26","refs":["tha-ap56:2"],"lines":["<b>Nhānakāle</b> <b>ca bodhiyā</b>ti bodhiyā pūjākaraṇasamayeti attho.","Sesaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap56:2"],["tha-ap56:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap56:1.1","mahābodhimaho ahū",0,2],["tha-ap56:1.3","vicittaṃ ghaṭamādāyā",0,3],["tha-ap56:1.3","gandhodakamadāsahaṃ",0,4],["tha-ap56:2.1","nhānakāle ca bodhiyā",1,0]],"before":[{"para":2564,"vripara":null,"title":"Gandhodakiyattheraapadānavaṇṇanā","lines":["Gandhodakiyattheraapadānavaṇṇanā"]},{"para":2565,"vripara":null,"title":"Gandhodakiyattheraapadānavaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Padumuttarabuddhassā</b>tiādikaṃ āyasmato gandhodakiyattherassa apadānaṃ.","Ayampi purimamunivaresu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave vivaṭṭūpanissayāni puññāni upacinanto padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle kulagehe nibbatto parinibbute bhagavati nagaravāsino bodhipūjaṃ kurumāne disvā vicittaghaṭe candanakappurāgaruādimissakasugandhodakena pūretvā bodhirukkhaṃ abhisiñci.","Tasmiṃ khaṇe devo mahādhārāhi pavassi.","Tadā so asanivegena kālaṃ kato.","Teneva puññakammena devaloke nibbatti, tattheva ṭhito “aho buddho, aho dhammo”tiādigāthāyo abhāsi.","Evaṃ so devamanussesu sampattiyo anubhavitvā sabbapariḷāhavippamutto nibbattanibbattaṭṭhāne sītibhāvamupagato sukhito imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kulagehe nibbatto viññutaṃ patto satthari pasanno pabbajitvā kammaṭṭhānaṃ ārabhitvā vipassanto nacirasseva arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Pubbe katapuññena <b>gandhodakiyatthero</b>ti pākaṭo ahosi. 25."]}],"after":[{"para":2568,"vripara":null,"title":"Gandhodakiyattheraapadānavaṇṇanā","lines":["Gandhodakiyattheraapadānavaṇṇanā samattā. 5."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
